 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "is the cyclic word whose particles are the list ",
 StyleBox["w", "TI"],
 ".",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"5bd962a1-8c89-4578-9923-efe3fabd9ff8"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
