  "3b00feda-9b21-4c50-9908-5568d64ff2de"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "gives the canonical rotation of ",
 StyleBox["w", "TI"],
 " times its Koszul sign, or ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["0", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f7db8293-d5eb-42d2-972a-13a5764e30ad"],
 " when a rotation sends ",
